BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      In ancient times, two sibling rivers flowed from opposite mountains-the River of Giving an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        d the River of Return. Each spring, the Elder Mountain would bestow five golden seeds up) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        on the River of Giving.) Tj ET
